# L §4.5 Whatever a version states is read as its rows are (tally 2.1.8 R12; #187's known-window comment): a same
# line known in a window that holds the cut is read joined and unjoined. bank[a2] and bank[b1] state one transfer and
# both fulfil save[2026-03]; joined, flows(save) is 950.00 PLN, unjoined RUN-RECORD: the plain line is HOLE-IMPRECISE
# naming both rows and the version (f, and k, n), windows each the 950.00 and the refusal (fe); a read on which the two
# agree answers (e). 2.1.7's refcore read the line as seen.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-04-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt


version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 900.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "a"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "b"

version joined
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-09)
  same bank[a2] = bank[b1]

ask f: flows(save, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-07
ask fe: flows(save, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-07 windows each
ask e: bal(konto, 2026-03-10) as known 2026-04-07
ask k: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-07
ask n: count(t in transfers over 2026-03) as known 2026-04-07
=== expect
e: 1 050.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-07
f: ?"date within window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-09) not precise enough for the cut 2026-04-07" (bank[a2], bank[b1], joined)
  cut 2026-04-07
fe [known of joined = 2026-04-05 .. 2026-04-07]: 950.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-07
fe [known of joined = 2026-04-08 .. 2026-04-09]: refused: RUN-RECORD bank[a2] and bank[b1] state one transfer and both fulfil save[2026-03]: state them same
  cut 2026-04-07
k: ?"date within window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-09) not precise enough for the cut 2026-04-07" (bank[a2], bank[b1], joined)
  cut 2026-04-07
n: ?"date within window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-09) not precise enough for the cut 2026-04-07" (bank[a2], bank[b1], joined)
  cut 2026-04-07
warning: WARN-NEGATIVE konto is below zero from 2026-04-15
warning: WARN-UNREAD place unexplained is read by nothing
